{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "John Comes Home for a Visit"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "What's New at Work?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le01ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Work"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Here are some words you use to talk about work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Responsibilities:<br/><br/> communications: oral and written messages from a company or institution<br/> marketing: promoting a business in different ways<br/> design: how something looks<br/> event planning: the processing of organizing large meetings<br/><br/>  Other work-related words:<br/><br/>  real-world experience:  things you learn and skills you develop at work, not school<br/> meeting: a group of people talking and making decisions together<br/> convention: a large meeting of many people<br/> convention center: a large building where conventions are organized<br/> brochure: a written document about a business<br/> professional: a person who is paid to do an activity<br/> amateur: a person who is not a professional <br/>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm getting some real-world experience in communications, marketing and design.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I am responsible for event planning."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "real-world"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "typical of things that happen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm getting some real-world experience at my job. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about work and business meetings."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "communications"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "formal messages from a company or institution, in writing or through the media"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I work in communications, marketing and design."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sausage"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "different types of meat tightly wrapped"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I organized a meeting of German sausage makers. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "amateur"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes a person who does an activity for pleasure, not as a job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Last week there was a convention for amateur astronomers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "professional"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes a person who is paid money to do an activity"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I organized a meeting of professional German sausage makers. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "astronomer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who studies outer space"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm interested in space, so I want to be an astronomer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to misspell"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to write something incorrectly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I misspelled the word <span class=\"italic\">astronomer</span>."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of 10 jobs. Write each job on a separate paper."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For each job, write 1 responsibility. Write each responsibility on a separate paper."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Place the papers face down so you can't see the words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Turn one paper over to see the word."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Turn another paper over. If they are a match, you take the words. If they are not a match, you place them face down again."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Continue until all the papers are taken."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I think of jobs and responsibilities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a memory game."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I play the memory game with a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le01ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le01ob03re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le01ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: What's new at work? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I'm still an intern at MechaTech.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Do you like it?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:   Yes, I do. I'm getting some real-world experience in communications, marketing and design. I am responsible for event planning.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: What kind of events do you plan?<br>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le01ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I organized a meeting of professional German sausage makers. They talked about spices a lot. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: That's cool. When was the event?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It was last week.  I didn't understand anything. The week before that, there was a convention for amateur astronomers. I prepared the marketing brochure.<br>", "id": 2, "time": "16000", "image": "engenn5le01ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Wow, that's really cool. How did it go?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  The brochure was good, except that I misspelled the word \u201castronomer\u201d. I spelled it \u201car\u201d instead of \u201cer\u201d.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Oh, Peter! <br>", "id": 3, "time": "35500", "image": "engenn5le01ob03re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about jobs and work. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can ask questions using words like what, when, where. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk or report about things, actions and events. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What's new at work? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you like your work? Why or why not?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner: "}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "What's new with you?"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data":